{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_035_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5798c92969b46a8e0df0878cfb9534b12ab562ea2688cd7f4fc4f49d8a9fbc4c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8268f6d95df736362b2b8e968069279c7653adb1b20c0045d8cc1a43685adac",
      "text": "这是，情人节巧克力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:def4f36efa2f3fdc3e98f97298edec824f012c120e578685cc4f9a7ba82136bb",
      "text": "开会的资料刚好整理完毕，\n我正准备稍作休息。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb6de61ddbcfb9c30e152258c18859b63bb81b43aecefc195beff7d90ad23817",
      "text": "适量的糖分对大脑也有益处。\n我就心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e61843769c50c6e843094ebe55ab850946462d2f23474eaa3a76e43ebf891fa",
      "text": "百忙之中为我花费这番心思，不胜感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2e5e740e65e9d792e234caf3e04f42b33a6ae9abc4b03a4dd4fa20f8ccb1ec",
      "text": "这份谢礼，到了白色情人节我必定奉还。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2510642e4a19211d0a12f4db43c0de6ff08589022ab0046e133b2aa898aeb7fc",
      "text": "是情人节的巧克力吗。\n特意为我准备，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce72feb70def6e456a521d57dd7b87dd5a439588e583bdc99bdd3248543065d9",
      "text": "恰好训练课也到了休息时间。\n我现在可以尝尝看吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54fadfd0952ed3d02658a1d7bf7b4107b82e4aa27d5d7e6bf68f2114e03a7877",
      "text": "当然可以！请用来缓解疲劳吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91783c4960b8ef4218cd7513e1b6d8d0c7907e22659fd38acbb98c7593f0aba3",
      "text": "请务必尝一尝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a71cb9226e77ebe69850ee67cfcef011b7ad896c968d9c4946ed885c0b905185",
      "text": "那么……我开动了。\n嗯，非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc5461915ca2422f47168d610b9f961c6f20f3b4b6e5fe45d49bfb34a93ad413",
      "text": "真不愧是制作人。\n对负责偶像的喜好把握得堪称完美吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fcbf1cd6136ed9d0b9e12c98cedb58890e6aeb4c49d381946ec89becda5a22",
      "text": "呼……\n你的调研能力着实令人折服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0f6dc1586289b4baaa06aec3c703852530dd6b78395ffe84a906b114fbf2f8",
      "text": "这份巧克力的谢礼，下个月我一定会奉上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_22:5_01_035_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71896306ac21c3687dd89b8464b5f40907f1d28be1cbba1e116d684806e42da2",
      "text": "届时，我也向你保证定会备好能让你发自内心\n感到喜悦的物品。敬请期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
